# The Orange Kingdom is staged into this directory by sesi-quest's
# integration/seedsigner-os/sync.sh (it drops opt/kingdom/ and start.sh here).
#
# None of it is tracked in this repo on purpose. dev/sesi-quest is the game's single
# source of truth; a second committed copy would drift from it silently, and the
# drift would only show up as a device behaving like an older build.
#
# The directory itself is tracked (via this file) so that BR2_ROOTFS_OVERLAY has
# something to copy on a fresh checkout, and the build reaches pi0/board/post-build.sh
# - which asserts the game is actually present and explains how to stage it.
*
!.gitignore
